	<TextRow
		Label="msg_r02_hardrock_04"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>なんでしょう……
けつえきが　ざわつくのです……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-26T12:28:54" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-26T12:28:41" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>なんでしょう……
血液が　ざわつくのです……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-26T12:31:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-26T12:29:01" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・アイテム入手後、ゾーンチェンジ前
※swanで新規作成</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
