	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_r02_boy2a_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ねーねー▼
オレね　１９ばんどうろの　だんさを
とびおりる　ヤツの　ライバルなんだ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-20T05:56:22" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:16" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ねーねー▼
オレね　１９番道路の　段差を
飛び降りる　ヤツの　ライバルなんだ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-20T05:56:37" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:16" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
※swanでメッセージ修正
　段差を降りるアニメ削除</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-14T08:20:26" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>BOY2</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-12T10:42:50" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>C</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-11T06:50:18" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:16" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ffff</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_r02_boy2_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ポケモンの　げんきが　ないからさ
くさむらを　さけて　あるいているよ▼
って　きみ　バッジを　８コも！
ひゃー！　えらそうにして　はずかしい</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-14T08:15:18" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:16" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ポケモンの　元気が　ないからさ
草むらを　さけて　歩いているよ▼
って　きみ　バッジを　８コも！
ひゃー！　偉そうにして　恥ずかしい</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-20T05:49:14" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:16" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
※swanでメッセージ修正</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-15T10:50:58" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>BOY2</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:16" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>C</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-11T06:50:18" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:16" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_r02_girl2_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>トレーナーとの　ポケモンしょうぶは
にげられない　しんけんしょうぶ！▼
なにより　あいする　ポケモンのまえで
トレーナーみずから　にげるのはねー</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-14T08:19:35" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:16" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>トレーナーとの　ポケモン勝負は
逃げられない　真剣勝負！▼
なにより　愛する　ポケモンの前で
トレーナー自ら　逃げるのはねー</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-20T05:52:50" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:16" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
※swanでメッセージ修正</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-15T10:51:00" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>GIRL2</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:16" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>C</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-11T06:50:18" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:16" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
